      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسرّق</span></b>  <i>He stole</i> [<i>by degrees,</i> or] <i>one thing and
then another.</i> (O, K.) So in the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسرّق</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِعْرِى</span> [<i>He stole my poetry, bit by bit</i>], used by
Ru-beh. (O, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also 3, in two places.

